00-03:00', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 6, 35, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2001, 'Freemium', 'zonajobs', 'zonajobs', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.bumeran.com.ar/empleos/2178880.html', '2026-04-10T07:05:55.110923');
