miércoles a 9 a 13hs, jueves y viernes de 14:30 a 18:30hs y dos sábados al mes de 9 a 13hs.', 0, 'Avellaneda, Buenos Aires', 'Presencial', 'Part-time', '06-04-2026', '06-04-2026 16:24:53', '08-04-2026 14:47:34', '2026-04-06', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-06T00:00:00-03:00', NULL, NULL, 5, 0, 6, 35, 1, 'https://imgbum.jobscdn.com/portal/img/empresas/1/static/logoMainPic_10220069_bum_v6374af45.jpg', 1, 0, NULL, 70, 'Simples', 'bumeran', 'simple', 1, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.bumeran.com.ar/empleos/1118220171.html', '2026-04-10T07:05:55.116747');
