s desafíos laborales. 📲 Instagram: talentowners 🌐 Web: www.academytalentowners.com', 0, 'Capital Federal, Buenos Aires', 'Presencial', 'Full-time', '07-04-2026', '07-04-2026 11:37:10', '07-04-2026 11:37:10', '2026-04-07', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-07T00:00:00-03:00', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 22, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1020, 'Aviso Talento', 'bumeran', 'talento', 1, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.bumeran.com.ar/empleos/1118221161.html', '2026-04-11T07:05:54.588000');
